OL,3,GNEWSAFifty firefighters at large
OL,4,Afactory fire in Antrim
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe roof of a factory building has
OL,7,Fpartially collapsed following a major
OL,8,Ffire in Antrim.
OL,10,FIt is understood the blaze at the Mivan
OL,11,Ffacility on the Greystone Road is now
OL,12,Funder control but operations are
OL,13,Fcontinuing to dampen down the area.
OL,15,FShortly after midnight, 74 firefighters
OL,16,Fwere deployed to the scene but later on
OL,17,FThursday morning that number was
OL,18,Freduced to 50.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
