OL,3,GNEWSAFifty firefighters at large
OL,4,Afactory fire in Antrim
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been advised to keep
OL,7,Ftheir windows and doors closed during
OL,8,Fthe operation which is expected to last
OL,9,Fmost of Thursday.
